  69:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** /****************************************************************************
  70:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Function:
  71:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     void rtcc_handler(void) (TMR1 version)
  72:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
  73:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Summary:
  74:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     maintain deviceTime (seconds) using the LCDIF flag/interrupt.
  75:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
  76:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Description:
  77:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     This function decrements seconds_counter until 0 and then increments deviceTime.
  78:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     seconds_counter reloads with CLOCK_PER_SEC.
  79:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     This version of the function uses Timer 1 as the time base.
  80:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     Timer 1 is reloaded with 0x8000 to cause TMR1IF to overflow every second.
  81:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****  
  82:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Precondition:
  83:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     None
  84:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
  85:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Parameters:
  86:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     None
  87:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
  88:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Returns:
  89:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     None
  90:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
  91:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Remarks:
  92:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     TMR1IF is not looked at or modified because there could be other tasks running
  93:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     on this interrupt.
  94:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   ***************************************************************************/
  95:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
